{
  "_": "Legal Desk 2.0 skins. One list for every dock style (Classic, Mac, Rubik), the menus, the Apps window, the drawer and the window title bars. The 10 skins are the same in all three styles; each style reads its own block: classic (nwg-dock CSS), mac (plate + tiles), rubik (cube plate + 6 sticker colours). menu = bg|acc|txt|sel colours shared by every Legal Desk window. bar = window title-bar button style. dr = drawer button radius.",
